    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into an abandoned hospital, where <strong>giant, hairy, wriggling caterpillars</strong> crawl through the eerie hallways. In this horror-themed VR mini-game, your mission is simple\u2014but unsettling: <strong>grab them by the neck and toss them into the bucket.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udda0 <strong>Immersive Horror Atmosphere</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 Experience the unsettling silence of the empty hospital as you track these grotesque creatures, each movement sending shivers down your spine.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > \ud83d\udc1b <strong>Unique Gameplay Mechanics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u2013 Reach out in VR to <strong>physically grab the caterpillars</strong>, feel them squirm in your grip, and aim carefully before throwing them into the bucket. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd04 <strong>Replayability &amp; Challenge</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 How many can you collect before time runs out? Test your reflexes, beat your own record, and embrace the creepy thrill of the hunt!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you dare to face the crawling horrors? Grab. Throw. Survive.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688410/extras/e2256fd5f1ce27b28c109f948aaf7a58.avif?t=1747313120\" data-has-big width=800 height=1066 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CATpillar Score\uff1a</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >normal- 1</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >green-5</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into an abandoned hospital, where <strong>giant, hairy, wriggling caterpillars</strong> crawl through the eerie hallways. In this horror-themed VR mini-game, your mission is simple\u2014but unsettling: <strong>grab them by the neck and toss them into the bucket.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udda0 <strong>Immersive Horror Atmosphere</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 Experience the unsettling silence of the empty hospital as you track these grotesque creatures, each movement sending shivers down your spine.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > \ud83d\udc1b <strong>Unique Gameplay Mechanics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u2013 Reach out in VR to <strong>physically grab the caterpillars</strong>, feel them squirm in your grip, and aim carefully before throwing them into the bucket. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd04 <strong>Replayability &amp; Challenge</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 How many can you collect before time runs out? Test your reflexes, beat your own record, and embrace the creepy thrill of the hunt!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you dare to face the crawling horrors? Grab. Throw. Survive.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688410/extras/e2256fd5f1ce27b28c109f948aaf7a58.avif?t=1747313120\" data-has-big width=800 height=1066 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CATpillar Score\uff1a</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >normal- 1</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >green-5</p>",
    "short_description": "\u201cCATpillAr\u201d is a horror-themed VR mini-game that requires you to collect big, juicy, hairy, creepy caterpillars crawling around an empty hospital. In VR, you can grab harmless giant caterpillars by the neck and throw them inside the bucket. Replay and see how many you can collect!",
